          "filename": "STREAKS FROM AUTOMOBILE LIGHTS ON \"THE STRIP\" AT NIGHT BEGINNING AT BAGNELL DAM, \"THE STRIP\" WINDS FOR A MILE OR SO... - NARA - 551321.jpg",
          "caption": "Scope and content:  STREAKS FROM AUTOMOBILE LIGHTS ON \"THE STRIP\" AT NIGHT BEGINNING AT BAGNELL DAM, \"THE STRIP\" WINDS FOR A MILE OR SO ALONG THE RIDGE TOPS TO THE SOUTH. ALONG BOTH SIDES OF THE EXTRA-WIDE ASPHALT PAVEMENT (TO ACCOMMODATE MORE PARKED CARS) CROWD DOZENS OF BOOTHS WITH SHOOTING GALLERIES, FORTUNE TELLERS AND ASSORTED ELECTRONIC GAMES. THERE ARE CHEAP AND MEDIUM-CHEAP RESTAURANTS WITH INFLATED PRICES, CARNIVAL RIDES AND FUNHOUSES, SHOPS AND SOUVENIR STANDS. CONFUSION PREVAILS WHEN EVEN MODERATE SIZED CROWDS TURN OUT",
